✅ موحّد في 5 أماكن:
   1. App.razor (JS) — fallback × 2
   2. TranslationStateService.CurrentLanguage
   3. TranslationStateService.InitializeAsync
   4. MainLayout.razor — CurrentLang
   5. Program.cs — SetDefaultCulture
✅ Fallback Order: localStorage → Cookie → "en"
✅ Cookie Name: .RubikCare.Language
✅ localStorage Key: RubikCare:Language
```

